# EvtGen decay-file skeleton for D_sJ signal MC.
#
# IMPORTANT
# ---------
# 1. Particle names depend on your EvtGen version. Replace D_sJ+ with the
#    actual name used in your decay table (D_s0*+, D_s1+, etc.).
# 2. For a dedicated signal sample, keep ONLY ONE D_sJ+ decay line per file.
#    Do not generate all modes in one sample if you need cross-feed matrices.
# 3. This is a skeleton, not a validated production decay file.

Decay D_sJ+
# Choose ONE line per signal sample:
# 1.0  D_s+  pi0;
# 1.0  D_s*+  pi0;
# 1.0  D_s+  gamma;
1.0  D_s+  pi+  pi-;
Enddecay

Decay D_s*+
1.0  D_s+  gamma;
Enddecay

Decay D_s+
1.0  phi  pi+;
Enddecay

Decay phi
1.0  K+  K-;
Enddecay

Decay pi0
1.0  gamma  gamma;
Enddecay

End
